  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">簡介：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">此模組透過改善既有建築結構，提升了《我的世界》中的村莊，讓它們更具生機且探索起來更富趣味。 <br><br>「Better Villages」改善了村莊的整體外觀與佈局，並新增了房屋設計。本模組旨在為玩家創造更具沉浸感與真實感的體驗。 <br><br>對於喜歡探索與互動《我的世界》村莊的玩家來說，這是一個絕佳的模組；它也為尋求豐富遊戲體驗的玩家提供了全新的玩法選項與挑戰。若您希望提升《我的世界》的遊戲性與體驗，「Better Villages」絕對是值得一試的模組！</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gSdaxuLQ0Fw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相容性：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模組的設計旨在確保最大程度的相容性。不過，部分模組可能需要搭配專屬的相容套件才能達到完美效果。整體而言，它應能與大多數模組正常運作，當然仍可能因些微未預期的問題或錯誤而有所差異。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">完美相容的模組：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Repurposed Structures</li>\n<li>ChoiceTheorem's Overhauled Village</li>\n<li>Bountiful（提供數據包 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-bountiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>）</li>\n<li>Ice and Fire: Dragons（提供數據包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-ice-and-fire-compat-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>）</li>\n<li>More Villagers（提供數據包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-more-villagers-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>）</li>\n<li>Immersive Engineering（提供數據包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-villages-immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>）</li>\n<li>Waystones</li>\n<li>以及更多...</li>\n</ul>\n<p>註：未來計畫支援更多相容模組，我們也正積極開發中。歡迎前往我們的 GitHub 提交相容性請求。（或加入我們的 Discord！）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 與 Fabric 模組載入器，適用版本從 1.16.5 至《我的世界》最新版本。請瀏覽下方連結以尋找您偏好的載入器版本：</p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必要模組：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">請務必安裝以下模組，因為它們是專案正常運作與完整體驗的必要條件。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Library Ferret </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相關連結：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">探索我們的資源並加入社群：</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Link Tree </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案由 BisectHosting 榮譽贊助。歡迎前往查看其服務，輕鬆以高品質與可靠度託管您的專案。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行動呼籲：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有任何問題嗎？需要協助嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord 或前往 GitHub，與社群互動並貢獻心力！</p>",
